# Root rules apply to the whole repo. Rules for one folder live in that
# folder's own .gitignore (containers/distributed/, splunk-snapshot/).

# --- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit these. The etc tarball contains splunk.secret, and passwd holds
# the Splunk user hashes, so these rules are generic on purpose: a backup
# dropped in a new folder must stay ignored without editing this file first.
**/.env
**/passwd
**/data-backup/
*.tar.gz
splunk.secret
*.lic
*.license
# Keys and certs (private keys, CSRs, Splunk combined PEMs)
*.pem
*.key
*.csr
*.crt

# --- Environments / build artefacts ------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**.code-workspace
**/archive
